            {
                "entry_id": "07bb28bb-693a-3f69-bbae-60d5ff931bba",
                "word": "Snoopy",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e11bdde7-5218-3825-a2ce-9ff12b98852a",
                        "entry_id": "07bb28bb-693a-3f69-bbae-60d5ff931bba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Charlie Brown's pet beagle in the comic strip Peanuts, by Charles M. Schulz; often representing doggish soulfulness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "26e8dc8e-a333-48e4-84d4-249f3fe460b6",
                                "sense_id": "e11bdde7-5218-3825-a2ce-9ff12b98852a",
                                "text": "Some dogs will be back porch familiars — beagles with soulful, Snoopy eyes: Dalmatians with spots; bassets with mitten ears; Siberian huskies with wolfish voices; Collies that look just like Lassie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29ee94b1-8b70-48c2-9afa-07e1eeb7b723",
                                "sense_id": "e11bdde7-5218-3825-a2ce-9ff12b98852a",
                                "text": "My daughter calls these \"Snoopy eyes\" after the childlike presentation of the beagle in Schulz's cartoon Peanuts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "105ee581-4efb-4ae3-8d85-16f17761985b",
                                "sense_id": "e11bdde7-5218-3825-a2ce-9ff12b98852a",
                                "text": "Mary Mann, another sophomore, sits on the roof of a red dog house, giving her most enigmatic Snoopy look."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee2510dc-9ab2-48c6-a320-259566800972",
                                "sense_id": "e11bdde7-5218-3825-a2ce-9ff12b98852a",
                                "text": "Being excessive or overzealous only gives the patient a surprised “Snoopy” look."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
